      "url": "https://www.epedagogia.com.br/materialbibliotecaonine/1280-dialeto-caipira.pdf",
      "pages": "§6b",
      "notes": "Cited for contrast: §6b describes the caipira r. Castro (2013: 566) and Silva (2023: 70) state that the capital and Santos use the tap while the rest of the state uses the retroflex."
